      "uid": "zhcn:1976a98ca80b5394a485b7ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们选择“神赞纪念”是为了展现\n谷野美酒在新马级累积的成果，\n所以在这场比赛不能跑得不上不下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e8be8d7614eac064b689a07e37173da580d63ddbe11f58a194f2e812dad1dda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
