      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“珍惜时间”。\n我为了回应她说的这句话，\n废寝忘食地持续研究──",
      "source_fingerprint": "82a7f8ec9952b5be28ca28d42714c6033baad970c64e6137ded2010c46d0fe7d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
